Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 01:50:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Move the doubts into threads.json so Telegram shows the link
 preview

The page inlined all 4,300+ doubts (~2 MB), which is too big for Telegram's
link-preview fetcher, so links showed no preview there even though the Open
Graph tags were right (Discord worked). Now index.html is ~32 KB and fetches
threads.json beside it; the site behaves the same.

- live-data.js: shared reader for the doubts already live (threads.json, or
  the old inline page for the first deploy) and writer for page + data
- tag-doubts.js / restyle-only.js use it; both workflows set DATA_FILE
- a local build without DATA_FILE still inlines the data (one offline file)

